      <h2>Digital Artwork &amp; Design Gallery</h2>
      <p>Alongside my background in emergency medical training and CPR education, I create digital illustrations, vector logos, and poster designs. All web graphics below are formatted at 72 DPI for screen display.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3>Project 1: "Ashfall" Sci-Fi Horror Movie Poster</h3>
      <p>A theatrical movie poster design featuring original creature illustration, atmospheric lighting, festival laurels, and custom billing block typography, shown alongside its initial concept sketch[cite: 1].</p>
      <img src="images/ashfall.jpg.jpg" alt="Ashfall movie poster design and concept sketch">
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3>Project 2: "The Great Wave off Kanagawa" Vector Study</h3>
      <p>A digital vector recreation of Katsushika Hokusai's iconic 1831 woodblock print, focusing on clean linework, layered wave forms, and color matching[cite: 2].</p>
      <img src="images/great-wave.jpg.jpg" alt="Vector recreation of The Great Wave off Kanagawa">
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3>Project 3: Mahi Ahi Ono Grindz Food Truck Logo</h3>
      <p>Brand identity and vector logo design created for a local Hawaiian food truck concept, featuring custom illustrations of a mahi-mahi and an ahi framing clean typography and a compass emblem[cite: 3].</p>
      <img src="images/mahi-ahi-logo.jpg.jpg" alt="Mahi Ahi Ono Grindz Food Truck logo design">
    </section>

